okとpermissions断片の端末settingsへの冪等マージ、`lattice hooks status`による検証を契約候補とする。\n- Spotter併載時の二重提案は許容し、住み分け設計を行わない。\n- 正典契約は`docs/01_integration-package.md`へ置く。\n\n## Scope\n\n本ToDoの着手時に専用campaign planを起票し、その起票をもってbacklog側を完了する。dotagents側のonboardingとverify-install追従はdotagents側waveが所有し、本campaignの範囲外と明記する。\n\n## 受入条件\n\n専用planがLattice storeへ正規authoringされ、install/status契約、Claude/Codex host、冪等merge、permissions、非目標、検証工程がtask graphとして保持される。","lane":"campaign-entry","narrative_anchor":null,"narrative_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L84","parent_task_id":null,"task_id":"bk-006","title":"sensor気づかせ導線のinstall契約を専用campaignとして起票する"}],"topology_digest":"6f7a6dd0a7878f32565defa3c5e0a8b2ad89088baacb039998d62e468f2dece5"},"plan_key":"backlog","predecessor":{"journal_head_digest":"a8e65a01670597144020455749b117bbaf3bd47ab2650f2ae333e4e027a57595","plan_digest":"2f427fe2640b6c79c027c920c021f16c73e99fac8ca47b9d1e534cd221f42a9c","plan_version":"v1"},"project_id":"lattice","reconciliation":{"predecessor_reconciliation_digest":"92cc393e969fba8db18676b77db06fcc72b2bdd368e156b1e326fad6379ae64f","reconciliation_digest":"ec1fdedc46fd5c074d78ef2e94df5954f84a0bb60f91b45ed77008a854e00341","source_inventory_digest":"d98657460810d6c8522455dae4a064b206d8d55afd41ae0290d95686708b054b"},"revision_digest":"71a2c420111846440c75b6ad867b8743ff2421df6a0cfdb948e7dc99d7329f5b","schema":"lattice.todo_revision.v1","source_inventory":{"active":[{"source_digest":"5dd794501014d1218d6416aa25620a13c48a756b84d04c0ae9e06e78df1d5d3a","source_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L79","task_id":"bk-001"},{"source_digest":"11945b3b69a19460421863e49bacf266350f76ecc99079f555d2fa0d3b70b689","source_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L80","task_id":"bk-002"},{"source_digest":"6447d53b047ab2b253917739589d03df2518f4c106af282b66d115a6127398ea","source_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L81","task_id":"bk-003"},{"source_digest":"d523311903812274531df32e9b31b155c70668ddee3b2c264105ebe2e23a3457","source_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L82","task_id":"bk-004"},{"source_diges